..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : PRICEMAINTENANCE.BUAPPLYCOMMENTS.BA
.. Author         : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : tiwe
.. Functionality  : Applys comments presettings into table rows.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Iterate over rows representing header of pricing
.select screen line 'F|formatstr("$,,;tbaumstufe=={1}", M|headerlevel)'
!NEXT
.continue END ? _G|mehr
.copy M|tbemneu = M|comments
.select screen line
.continue NEXT
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
